     "status" -> "None", "summary" -> 
    "ChebyshevSupremum[{c1, c2, ..., cn}, kind] returns max |p(x)| over x \
\\[Element] [-1, 1] for p(x) := \\[CapitalSigma]_k = 0^n ck Tk( x) on the \
grid of Chebyshev points of kind. ChebyshevSupremum[{c1, c2, ...}] assumes \
kind = 2. ChebyshevSupremum[{c1, c2, ..., cn}, kind, m] search the grid of m \
Chebyshev points (m \\[GreaterGreater] n).", "synonyms" -> {}, 
